# QGIS Project Template for SiteOwl XR Surveyor
# This is a placeholder - create the actual project in QGIS and save as .qgz
# 
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Open QGIS
# 2. Project → New
# 3. Project Properties → CRS → Select EPSG:4326 (WGS 84)
# 4. Install QuickMapServices plugin
# 5. Web → QuickMapServices → Google → Google Satellite
# 6. Save as: siteowl_surveyor_template.qgz
#
# LAYERS TO ADD:
# - survey_boundary (polygon - your site area)
# - devices_captured (points - from your CSV)
# - calibration_points (points - anchor locations)
# - photo_locations (points - where photos taken)
#
# This template will be loaded for each survey project.
